<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 7.98 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 7.98 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it reduced the cut-off price at its weekly 91-day treasury bills auction to 98.05 rupees from 98.10.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yiled rose to 7.98 percent from 7.77 percent.</p>
